<title>UK: Wassall yr pretax profit up 30 pct.</title>
<headline>Wassall yr pretax profit up 30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996. (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		22.2		   vs 17.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.0		    vs 3.95</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 7.1		    vs 5.5</p>
